{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2022-07-18 10:00:00', 'title': 'EMERSON JOINS RE100, TARGETING 100% RENEWABLE ELECTRICITY BY 2030', 'text': "ST. LOUIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EMERSON (NYSE: EMR), A GLOBAL LEADER IN TECHNOLOGY AND SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS, HAS JOINED RE100, A GLOBAL INITIATIVE BRINGING TOGETHER BUSINESSES COMMITTED TO 100% RENEWABLE ELECTRICITY. THIS ALIGNMENT WITH OTHER SUSTAINABILITY PIONEERS IN THE EFFORT LED BY CLIMATE GROUP, IN PARTNERSHIP WITH CDP, IS THE LATEST STEP IN EMERSON'S PLAN TO SOURCE 100% RENEWABLE ELECTRICITY BY 2030. TO ACHIEVE THIS 2030 TARGET, EMERSON WILL LEVERAGE A BROAD RANGE OF RENEWABLE ENERGY SOURCES,"}